'''Sathankhamun VIII''' (サタンカーメン8号, ''Satankāmen 8 Gō'', '''Sathankhamun VIII''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Hannya]] introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Aku Reincarnation (Merciless)|Rashomon]].  It was added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sathankhamun VIII
|image = E 585.png
|first appearance = [[Aku Reincarnation (Merciless)|Rashomon]]<br>'''ZL:''' [[ZL 38-6|Sub-chapter 38 - Stage 38-6]]
|money drop = 4,500¢ - 17,775¢
}}

==Enemy==
Sathankhamun VIII has no [[Shield]], meaning that only raw damage is needed, but it has the health to make up for it. It works very similarly to Hannya, with a less powerful attack but the ability to slow cats for 2 seconds. Thanks to its Omni Strike's piercing range, Sathankhamun will also tend to advance much more easily and hit considerably more targets, making it more aggressive.

